set {key_known} = true
join detective right
detective: Tell me about Dracula’s safe.
join gardener left
gardener: If you asked old Drac’ ‘bout that thing, he’d’ve sat you down for a good long hour and told you all about it.
gardener: He said he’s got gold in there…
gardener: …jewels…
gardener: …rare art.
gardener: Real fancy stuff.
gardener: He always kept the key on him, right in his upper-left-inner pocket of his cloak.
gardener: Right next to his heart.
gardener: …
gardener: Do vampires have hearts?
gardener: Anyway.
gardener: That’s what I know ‘bout the safe.
join detective_thinking right
detective_thinking: I should see if Dracula still has the key on him.
